    "human_label": "Read"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "sentence": "S = Σₖ₌₂⁽∞⁾ f(k) = Σₖ₌₂⁽∞⁾ (1/2ᵏ + 1/3ᵏ + … + 1/2008ᵏ).",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Read"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "sentence": "Step 1.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Monitor"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "sentence": "Change the order of summation: S = Σⱼ₌₂^(2008) Σₖ₌₂⁽∞⁾ (1/jᵏ).",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Plan"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "sentence": "Step 2.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Monitor"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "sentence": "Sum the inner geometric series.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Plan"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "sentence": "For fixed j (with j ≥ 2), we have a geometric series with first term a = 1/j² and common ratio r = 1/j (|r| < 1):\n  Σₖ₌₂⁽∞⁾ (1/jᵏ) = a/(1 - r) = (1/j²) / (1 - 1/j) = (1/j²) / ((j - 1)/j) = 1/(j(j - 1)).",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "sentence": "Step 3.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Monitor"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "sentence": "Substitute back into the outer sum: S = Σⱼ₌₂^(2008) 1/(j(j - 1)).",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "sentence": "Step 4.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Monitor"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "sentence": "Telescoping Sum.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Plan"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "sentence": "Notice that:\n  1/(j(j - 1)) = 1/(j - 1) - 1/j.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Analyze"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "sentence": "Thus:\n  S = (1/1 - 1/2) + (1/2 - 1/3) + … + (1/2007 - 1/2008).",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "sentence": "Most of the terms cancel, leaving:\n  S = 1 - 1/2008 = (2008 - 1) / 2008 = 2007/2008.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "sentence": "Therefore, the sum is 2007/2008.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Answer"
  }
